OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in M5 car and lorry crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man died when the car he was driving
OL,6,Fcrashed with a lorry on the M5.
OL,8,FEmergency services were called shortly
OL,9,Fafter 21:40 BST on Tuesday to the
OL,10,Fnorthbound carriageway between
OL,11,Fjunctions three and four near
OL,12,FHalesowen. The 39-year-old man died at
OL,13,Fthe scene despite the efforts of
OL,14,Fparamedics.
OL,16,FThe man's family were being supported,
OL,17,FWest Midlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
