OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in M5 car and lorry crash
OL,4,
OL,5,FTheir Serious Collision Investigation
OL,6,FUnit is working to establish the
OL,7,Fcircumstances of the crash. The lorry
OL,8,Fdriver was helping officers with their
OL,9,Finquiries, a spokesperson added.
